  "changes": {
    "package.json": "Replace only fast-glob runtime dependency with exact glob13.0.6; omit upstream development-only eslint dependency from local file package. Package version/name and all42 exported rule implementations retained.",
    "dist/utils/get-root-dirs.js": "Migrate only Next root-directory consumer to glob13; preserve directories-only, followed symlinks, absolute/relative prefixes, explicit trailing slash and trailing globstar semantics. Negated extglob includes dot paths as original did. Actual upstream parity fixtures validate results and unchanged no-html-link-for-pages diagnostics; not a general fast-glob shim."
